    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Compiles official STREAM src/stream.c inline and runs build/stream with OMP_NUM_THREADS. num_threads: OpenMP workers. array_size: STREAM_ARRAY_SIZE. num_iterations: NTIMES. numactl is not used. output_format: csv"
  },
  {
